  keyword                = {Backpropagation; Complex networks; Computational linguistics; Convolutional neural networks; Decision making; Deep neural networks; Deep reinforcement learning; Electric transformers; Embeddings; Ethical aspects; Information retrieval; Multilayer neural networks; Natural language processing systems; Semantics; Vector spaces; Deep learning; Language model; Large language model; Machine-learning; Neural-networks; Reinforcement learnings; Rules based systems; Symbolic reasoning; Transformer; Reinforcement learning},
